Source: JJM, IMIS \n "}, {"k": "questions|ls|17|7|UNSTARRED |723", "t": "Installed Power Capacity", "head": " \n \n \nGOVERNMENT OF INDIA \nMINISTRY OF POWER \nLOK SABHA \nUNSTARRED QUESTION NO.723 \nANSWERED ON 02.12.2021 \n \nINSTALLED POWER CAPACITY \n \n723. MS. RAMYA HARIDAS: \n \n Will the Minister of POWER \nbe pleased to state: \n \n(a)  the total installed capacity of power during the last five years, State-wise; \n \n(b) the contribution of private and public sector in the total installed capacity; and \n \n(c) the share of renewable energy in the total installed capacity during the said \nperiod? \nA N S W E R \n \nTHE MINISTER OF POWER AND NEW & RENEWABLE ENERGY  \n \n(SHRI  R.K. SINGH) \n \n(a): State-wise details of total Installed Capacity of power during the last five years and \nthe current year (as on 30.10.2021) are given at Annexure-I. \n \n(b): Sector-wise details of Installed Capacity and % share during the last 5 years  and \nthe current year are given at Annexure-II. As on 31.10.2021, the share of Public Sector is \n51.86 % whereas the share of Private Sector is 48.14% in All India Installed Capacity.  \n \n(c): Mode-wise details of  Installed Capacity along with Renewable Energy Sources \n(RES) % (including Hydro) share during the last 5 years and the current year are given at \nAnnexure-III.  As on 31.10.2021, the share of Renewable Energy Sources is 38.27% in total \nInstalled Capacity. \n \n \n******** \n  \n\nANNEXURE-I \nANNEXURE REFERRED TO IN REPLY TO PAR T (a) OF UNSTARRED QUESTION NO. 723 \nANSWERED IN THE LOK SABHA ON 02.12.2021 \nSector-wise, State -wise total allocated Installed Capacity of power during the last five \nyears and current year (as on 30.10.2021) \nState  Ownership/ \nSector \nInstalled Capacity (MW) \nAs on \n31.03.2017 \nAs on \n31.03.201\n8 \nAs on \n31.03.2019 \nAs on \n31.03.202\n0 \nAs on \n31.03.202\n1 \nAs on \n31.10.2021 \nDelhi State 1935.40 1935.40 1935.40 1800.40 1800.40 1800.40 \nPrivate 1033.49 1098.79