 475 19 \n37. Ratlam 1,18,150 46 52,508 21 1,753 91 1,003 86 \n38. Rewa 1,14,699 25 82,073 18 2,290 81 818 39 \n39. Sagar 94,107 24 65,880 17 1,377 55 708 43 \n40. Satna 69,959 17 59,040 14 2,424 91 1,313 80 \n41. Sehore 99,762 43 81,354 35 1,469 100 703 100 \n42. Seoni 91,405 32 47,758 17 1,886 69 1,063 80 \n43. Shahdol 55,935 26 42,945 20 1,199 59 449 52 "}, {"k": "questions|ls|17|7|UNSTARRED |883", "t": "ISO Certification of MSME Units", "head": "GOVERNMENT\n \nOF\n \nINDIA\n \nMINISTRY\n \nOF \nMICRO,\n \nSMALL\n \nAND\n \nMEDIUM\n \nENTERPRISES\n\\\n \n \nLOK SABHA \n \nUNSTARRED\n \nQUESTION No. 883\n \nTO\n \nBE\n \nANSWERED\n \nON\n \n02.12.2021\n \n \n4545\nISO CERTIFICATION OF MSME UNITs\n \n \n883\n.\n \nSHRIMATI RITA BAHUGUNA JOSHI:\n \n \n \nWill\n \n \nthe \n \nMinister\n \n \nof \n \nMICRO,\n \n \nSMALL\n \n \nAND \n \nMEDIUM\n \n \nENTERPRISES\n \n \nbe\n \npleased\n \nto \nstate:\n \n \n(a)\n \nthe number of small units which got registered in Udyam Portal till now after \ninclusion of the Retail and Wholesale Traders under MSME definition, State\n-\nwise;  \n \n(b)\n \nthe number of MSME units which got the ISO certification in the country \nduring the last three years, State\n-\nwise; and \n \n(c)\n \nthe details of the subsidy given to such units for the reimbursement of \napplication for ISO certification in the country\n?                \n \n \n  \n \nANSWER\n \n \nMINISTER\n \nOF \nMICRO,\n \nSMALL\n \nAND \nMEDIUM\n \nENTERPRISES\n \n(SHRI\n \nNARAYAN RANE)\n \n \n(a):\n \nThe Government has included Retail and Wholesale Trades as MSMEs and they \nare allowed to be registered on Udyam Registration Portal from 02.07.2021. As per \nUdyam\n \nRegistration Portal, the number of small units registered in all India was 72,746 \n(since 02.07.2021 to 30.11.2021). \nThe State/UT wise details are attached as Annexure.\n \n \n(b) & (c):\n \nISO Certification Scheme has been merged with Zero Defect & Zero \nEffect (ZE\nD) certification scheme under National Manufacturing Competitiveness \nProgramme (NMCP) on 28.06.2016.  \n \n \n \n \n \n***\n \n \n \n \n \n \n \n \n \n \n\nAnnexure\n \n \nAnnexure referred to in reply to part (a) of Lok Sabha Unstarred Question No. 883 for \nanswer on 02.12.2021.\n \n \nS. No.\n \nState/UT\n \nSmall (Classified)\n \n1\n \nANDHRA PRADESH\n \n2723\n \n2\n \nARUNACHAL PRADESH\n \n25\n \n3\n \nASSAM\n \n1165\n \n4\n \nBIHAR\n \n1997\n \n5\n \nCHHATTISGARH\n \n1203\n \n6\n \nGOA\n \n148\n \n7\n \nGUJARAT\n \n7206\n \n8\n \nHARYANA\n \n3062\n \n9\n \nHIMACHAL PRADESH\n \n301\n \n10\n \nJHARKHAND\n \n873\n \n11\n \nKARNATAKA\n \n4970\n \n12\n \nKERALA\n \n2325\n \n13\n \nMADHYA PRADESH\n \n3091\n \n14\n \nMAHARASHTRA\n \n10727\n \n15\n \nMANIPUR\n \n80\n \n16\n \nMEGHALAYA\n \n47\n \n17\n \nMIZORAM\n \n35\n \n18\n \nNAGALAND\n \n19\n \n19\n \nODISHA\n \n1404\n \n20\n \nPUNJAB\n \n2472\n \n21\n \nRAJASTHAN\n \n3624\n \n22\n \nSIKKIM\n \n21\n \n23\n \nTAMIL NADU\n \n7019\n \n24\n \nTELANGANA\n \n2483\n \n25\n \nTRIPURA\n \n85\n \n26\n \nUTTAR PRADESH\n \n5644\n \n27\n \nUTTARAKHAND\n \n657\n \n28\n \nWEST BENGAL\n \n3784\n \n29\n \nANDAMAN AND NICOBAR \nISLANDS\n \n56\n \n30\n \nCHANDIGARH\n \n241\n \n31\n \nDADAR AND NAGAR HAVELI\n \n65\n \n32\n \nDAMAN AND DIU\n \n31\n \n33\n \nDELHI\n \n4606\n \n34\n \nJAMMU AND KASHMIR\n \n411\n \n35\n \nLADAKH\n \n10\n \n36\n \nLAKSHADWEEP\n \n0\n \n37\n \nPUDUCHERRY\n \n136\n \nTotal\n \n72,746\n \n "}, {"k": "questions|ls|17|7|UNSTARRED |884", "t": "Road Projects in Assam", "head": "GOVERNMENT OF INDIA \nMINISTRY OF ROAD TRANSPORT AND HIGHWAYS \n  \nLOK SABHA  \nUNSTARRED QUESTION NO. 884 \nANSWERED ON 2ND DECEMBER, 2021  \n  \nROAD PROJECTS IN ASSAM \n  \n884. SHRI PALLAB LOCHAN DAS:  \n  \n                         Will the Minister of ROAD TRANSPORT AND HIGHWAYS   \nसड़क  परिवहन  औि  िाजमार्ग  मंत्री \nbe pleased to state: \n  \n(a) the details of completed and undergoing four -laning of National Highways \nprojects in Assam;  \n(b) the present st